1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,954
Could you smell with your fingers? Ants can! Well, sort of!

2
00:00:04,125 --> 00:00:06,432
Big secrets of tiny bugs!

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,899
This is Crumb, the ant! Let's zoom in!

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,192
Ants sniff with their antennae!

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,300
Tap, tap, hello!

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,828
So, they follow a map? Nope!

7
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,290
They follow a smell trail!

8
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,636
Some ants keep tiny cows!

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,897
Six legs? In you go!

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,328
Can I hold the lens? Not yet!

11
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,300
I can carry it!

12
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,000
What can YOU smell right now?
